{"page":160,"verses":[{"verse_key":"7:74","surah":7,"ayah":74,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱذْكُرُوٓا۟ إِذْ جَعَلَكُمْ خُلَفَآءَ مِنۢ بَعْدِ عَادٍ وَبَوَّأَكُمْ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ تَتَّخِذُونَ مِن سُهُولِهَا قُصُورًا وَتَنْحِتُونَ ٱلْجِبَالَ بُيُوتًا ۖ فَٱذْكُرُوٓا۟ ءَالَآءَ ٱللَّهِ وَلَا تَعْثَوْا۟ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ مُفْسِدِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Remember how He made you heirs after 'Ad and settled you in the land to build yourselves castles on its plains and carve houses out of the mountains: remember God’s blessings and do not spread corruption in the land,’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱذْكُرُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"And remember","transliteration":"wa-udh'kurū","verse_key":"7:74"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"7:74"},{"pos":3,"ar":"جَعَلَكُمْ","en_gloss":"He made you","transliteration":"jaʿalakum","verse_key":"7:74"},{"pos":4,"ar":"خُلَفَآءَ","en_gloss":"successors","transliteration":"khulafāa","verse_key":"7:74"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"7:74"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بَعْدِ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿdi","verse_key":"7:74"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَادٍۢ","en_gloss":"Aad","transliteration":"ʿādin","verse_key":"7:74"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَبَوَّأَكُمْ","en_gloss":"and settled you","transliteration":"wabawwa-akum","verse_key":"7:74"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"7:74"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"7:74"},{"pos":11,"ar":"تَتَّخِذُونَ","en_gloss":"You take","transliteration":"tattakhidhūna","verse_key":"7:74"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"7:74"},{"pos":13,"ar":"سُهُولِهَا","en_gloss":"its plains","transliteration":"suhūlihā","verse_key":"7:74"},{"pos":14,"ar":"قُصُورًۭا","en_gloss":"palaces","transliteration":"quṣūran","verse_key":"7:74"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَتَنْحِتُونَ","en_gloss":"and you carve out","transliteration":"watanḥitūna","verse_key":"